   "rendered": "<p><strong>225 Authentic Farm Animal Sounds &amp; Countryside Ambiences</strong></p>\n<p>Bring your rural scenes, games, films, videos, and other projects to life with <strong>225 authentic farm animal sounds and countryside ambiences</strong>. This collection was recorded over <strong>10 years in real farms, barns, yards, and natural rural environments</strong>, capturing genuine animal behavior and the natural atmosphere of the countryside.</p>\n<p>These are <strong>real-world field recordings, not studio recordings</strong>. Some animals were recorded as isolated sounds, while many recordings include the natural ambience of the farm, barn, yard, birds, wind, and surrounding environment. Because the sounds were captured in real places, they are not perfectly controlled or sterile — and that natural character is part of what makes them unique.</p>\n<p>Every recording is an original field recording, giving you a varied collection of authentic animal sounds and realistic rural atmospheres for film, animation, games, videos, documentaries, podcasts, and other creative projects.</p>\n<h2>What&#8217;s Included in the Library</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Livestock:</strong> Cow, Donkey, Horse, Pig, Goat, Sheep</li>\n<li><strong>Poultry &amp; Birds:</strong> Chicken, Rooster, Duck, Goose, Turkey, Peacock</li>\n<li><strong>Farm &amp; Countryside Ambiences:</strong> Natural recordings of farms, barns, yards, and rural environments</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://orangefreesounds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Ultimate_Farm_Animal_Sound_Effects_Tracklist.pdf\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,2\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">View / Download Full Sound List (PDF)</b></a></p>\n<h4>Recording Equipment</h4>\n<p>Tascam DR-100MKIII, Zoom H2essential, Zoom H5, Zoom H4n, Yamaha POCKETRAK C24</p>\n<h4>Technical Details</h4>\n<p><strong>Author:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.orangefreesounds.com/\">Orange Free Sounds</a><br />\n<strong>Total:</strong> 225 WAV sound files<br />\n<strong>Quality:</strong> 24-bit / 96 kHz WAV, 24-bit / 48 kHz WAV, 16-bit / 44.1 kHz WAV<br />\n<strong>Total Length:</strong> 45:14 minutes<br />\n<strong>File Size:</strong> 587 MB<br />\n<strong>Price:</strong> $14.99</p>\n<h3>Licensing Terms</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Royalty-Free:</strong> One-time purchase grants unlimited use in commercial and personal projects.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>How to Purchase</h3>\n<p>You can purchase the <strong>Ultimate Farm Animal Sound Effects Library</strong> directly through Gumroad. Click the link below to view the collection and complete your purchase:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://orangesound.gumroad.com/l/UltimateReal-WorldFarmAnimalSoundEffectsLibrary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Ultimate Farm Animal Sound Effects Library</strong></a></p>\n<p><u>Short demo of sounds</u></p>\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" id=\"audio-57972-1\" preload=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"audio/mpeg\" src=\"https://orangefreesounds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UltimateReal-WorldFarmAnimalSoundEffectsLibrary.mp3?_=1\" /><a href=\"https://orangefreesounds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UltimateReal-WorldFarmAnimalSoundEffectsLibrary.mp3\">https://orangefreesounds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UltimateReal-WorldFarmAnimalSoundEffectsLibrary.mp3</a></audio>\n<table style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 25%; cell-height: 131px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid white;\"><a href=\"https://orangesound.gumroad.com/l/UltimateReal-WorldFarmAnimalSoundEffectsLibrary?_gl=1*1h48e4a*_ga*MTAxNzIyODkzMC4xNzU0MzI2ODcz*_ga_6LJN6D94N6*czE3ODcwNjExOTkkbzE4JGcxJHQxNzg3MDY0MTExJGozNCRsMCRoMA..\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-48 size-full\" src=\"https://orangefreesounds.com/wp-content/uploads/Kuglice/buy-sound-wav.jpg\" alt=\"Ultimate Farm Animal Sound Effects Library (Commercial Pack) WAV sounds | Orange Free Sounds\" width=\"131\" height=\"129\" /></a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 25%; cell-height: 131px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid white;\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 25%; cell-height: 131px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid white;\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 25%; cell-height: 131px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid white;\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
